 {
  "name": "padded-header-in-dd",
  "markdown": "level\n: (`string`) The level. Default is `medium`.\n\n  Error correction level|Redundancy\n  :--|:--|:--\n  low|20%\n  medium|38%\n\nscale\n: (`int`) Scale.\n",
  "html": "<dl>\n<dt>level</dt>\n<dd>(<code>string</code>) The level. Default is <code>medium</code>.\n<table>\n  <thead>\n      <tr>\n          <th style=\"text-align: left\">Error correction level</th>\n          <th style=\"text-align: left\">Redundancy</th>\n          <th></th>\n      </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n      <tr>\n          <td style=\"text-align: left\">low</td>\n          <td style=\"text-align: left\">20%</td>\n          <td></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n          <td style=\"text-align: left\">medium</td>\n          <td style=\"text-align: left\">38%</td>\n          <td></td>\n      </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n</dd>\n<dt>scale</dt>\n<dd>(<code>int</code>) Scale.</dd>\n</dl>\n"
 },
 {
  "name": "blank-before-table-in-item",
  "markdown": "Prep:\n1. Create it.\n2. Generate a key:\n   ```shell\n   ssh-keygen\n   ```\n   This writes two files.\n3. Add variables:\n\n    | Name | Value |\n    |------|-------|\n    | `A`  | `b`   |\n\nOnce done.\n",
  "html": "<p>Prep:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Create it.</li>\n<li>Generate a key:\n<pre data-lang=\"shell\" data-ordinal=\"0\">ssh-keygen</pre>\nThis writes two files.</li>\n<li>Add variables:\n<table>\n  <thead>\n      <tr>\n          <th>Name</th>\n          <th>Value</th>\n      </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n      <tr>\n          <td><code>A</code></td>\n          <td><code>b</code></td>\n      </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Once done.</p>\n"
